#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:3
#: c3934257644e463bb0703307aa35c4d8
msgid "分子构象（Molecular Conformers）"
msgstr "Molecular Conformers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:5
#: ef606769fc834529bbeeabdc457164a5
msgid "**分类：** 分子与溶剂"
msgstr "**Category:** Molecules and solvents"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:7
#: 7be00c0cdc04483982c4060188f523e8
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:9
#: 68a5b5efb4d4400e87e9170aa4363157
msgid "从一个非周期分子或三维周期分子体系出发，按当前几何识别分子键和可旋转单键，旋转单键一侧的原子子树，并可叠加少量坐标噪声，生成一组同组成构象。"
msgstr ""
"Starting from a nonperiodic molecule or a three-dimensionally periodic molecular "
"system, identify molecular bonds and rotatable single bonds from the current "
"geometry, rotate the atomic subtree on one side of a single bond, and optionally add "
"small coordinate noise to generate conformers with unchanged composition."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:11
#: f31c57f799e0410a88bbc045844bd258
msgid "卡片采用“尽力生成”合同：每个输入最多生成指定数量的构象。候选若未通过键长或非键距离检查会重试或跳过，因此实际数量可能更少。"
msgstr ""
"The card uses a best-effort contract: each input produces up to the requested number "
"of conformers. Candidates that fail bond-length or nonbonded-distance checks are "
"retried or skipped, so the actual count may be smaller."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:13
#: 0788992fd0f44929a6cc027c2ab42105
msgid "界面预览会先显示首个输入的原子数、检测键数、可旋转键数、分子连通分量、边界模式和理论最大输出数。若检测结果与化学直觉不符，应先调整拓扑识别参数。"
msgstr ""
"The preview first shows the atom count, detected-bond count, rotatable-bond count, "
"molecular connected components, boundary mode, and theoretical maximum output count "
"for the first input. If detection conflicts with chemical expectations, adjust "
"topology-detection parameters first."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:15
#: 0108a9c67cba4e86b7279ed65e19722d
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:17
#: bb57b7b624c0478c84e3b2df1dd86f68
msgid "程序以共价半径和当前原子距离构造几何拓扑。距离满足检测半径且估算 Pauling 键级超过阈值的原子对会成为拓扑边："
msgstr ""
"The program constructs a geometric topology from covalent radii and current "
"interatomic distances. An atom pair becomes a topology edge when its distance lies "
"within the detection radius and its estimated Pauling bond order exceeds the "
"threshold:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:19
#: 72818f25f4d54462988b24163f8c6cea
msgid ""
"\n"
"B_{ij}=\\exp\\left(\\frac{r_i^{\\mathrm{cov}}+r_j^{\\mathrm{cov}}-d_{ij}}{c}\\right)."
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:23
#: fb10ba8eb9fd4a4eb6f6d4ca2ba8d89b
msgid "删除后能把拓扑分成两个子树的内部键才可能旋转；环内键不会成为这种桥边。每个候选随机选择不超过设定数量的可旋转键，并为每条键抽取角度增量"
msgstr ""
"Only an internal bond whose removal divides the topology into two subtrees can "
"rotate; bonds within rings are not such bridges. Each candidate randomly selects no "
"more than the configured number of rotatable bonds and samples an angle increment for"
" every selected bond"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:25
#: cbc41503af254045a544095db970dfe9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta\\theta\\sim U(\\theta_{\\min},\\theta_{\\max}).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:29
#: b9de661349a746db93d8bd08dfb1c431
msgid "旋转完成后，可再对每个原子的三个笛卡尔分量加入独立高斯噪声"
msgstr ""
"After rotation, independent Gaussian noise may be added to each atom's three "
"Cartesian components"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:31
#: a4588f3d00884605b21399c2ac314ce9
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta r_{i\\alpha}\\sim\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma^2).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:35
#: abfd5fe04c354f0c82f335341c6c4784
msgid ""
"候选随后检查原始键对的长度和非键原子的最近距离。失败重试时，扭转角增量与坐标噪声都会减半。周期输入使用完整非正交晶胞的最小镜像几何；非周期输出写入一个仅用于显示的立方 "
"cell，并保持 PBC 关闭。"
msgstr ""
"The candidate is then checked against original bond-pair lengths and minimum "
"distances between nonbonded atoms. On a failed retry, both torsion increments and "
"coordinate noise are halved. Periodic inputs use minimum-image geometry for the full "
"non-orthogonal cell. Nonperiodic outputs receive a cubic cell used only for display "
"while PBC remains disabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:37
#: ebb6c1b9bb1c4a8aa3ff825f8754e78f
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:39
#: 640e2f4cae2f4dda80de9010cd9722c2
msgid "下面是一条带一个可旋转内部键的 C4 链。保存为 XYZ 后载入即可观察预览中的 `3 detected bonds / 1 rotatable`："
msgstr ""
"The following C4 chain has one rotatable internal bond. Save it as XYZ and load it to"
" see `3 detected bonds / 1 rotatable` in the preview:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:41
#: 137b327da3fd43f89884d525cb6f867e
msgid ""
"4\n"
"C4 torsion example\n"
"C  0.000  0.000  0.000\n"
"C  1.400  0.000  0.000\n"
"C  2.800  0.200  0.000\n"
"C  4.100  0.200  1.000\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:50
#: 8b209af4ab9c497284aa5353fd894de7
msgid ""
"建议先用 20 个最大输出、`-60° → 60°`、每个输出旋转 1 条键、`0.01 Å` "
"坐标噪声和固定种子。生成后抽查二面角分布、连续键长和非键最近距离，再决定是否扩大角度或输出数量。"
msgstr ""
"Begin with a maximum of 20 outputs, `-60° → 60°`, one rotated bond per output, `0.01 "
"Å` coordinate noise, and a fixed seed. After generation, spot-check the dihedral "
"distribution, connected bond lengths, and nearest nonbonded distances before widening"
" the angle or increasing the output count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:52
#: 4d6eff6793f047f89a9f88417573604e
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:54
#: 37df631a64c841a8b76004b225874847
msgid "构象采样"
msgstr "Conformation sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:56
#: 5aee7e35f8e14e9392614d2e6ec75fe0
msgid "最大输出数（perturb_per_frame）"
msgstr "Maximum Outputs (perturb_per_frame)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:58
#: 964d28a7032246c78b04031214d306e9
msgid "`int`，默认 20。每个输入最多请求的构象数；保护检查可能使实际输出更少。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 20. Maximum requested conformers per input; protection checks may "
"reduce the actual count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:60
#: fa45e55eeff3497fa83c891d66b344ae
msgid "扭转增量范围（torsion_range_deg）"
msgstr "Torsion-Increment Range (torsion_range_deg)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:62
#: 8de3eefb49134326aeea1406cef07a5d
msgid "`tuple[float,float]`，默认 `(-60,60)`，单位为度。它是加到当前构象上的角度增量，不是绝对二面角。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float,float]`, default `(-60,60)`, in degrees. This is an angle increment "
"added to the current conformation, not an absolute dihedral angle."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:64
#: 198c48091acc4ad3a5453b66b32e3e53
msgid "每个输出旋转的键数（max_torsions_per_conf）"
msgstr "max_torsions_per_conf"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:66
#: 76e2c7b1691d47b983e8b3b459330e9b
msgid "`int`，默认 1。实际旋转数不会超过预览中的可旋转键数；设为 0 时仅保留坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1. The actual number of rotations cannot exceed the rotatable-bond "
"count shown in the preview. Set it to 0 to retain coordinate noise only."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:68
#: d8e1997423d9474c953ed6ddb83c2cb0
msgid "坐标噪声（gaussian_sigma）"
msgstr "Coordinate Noise (gaussian_sigma)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:70
#: 4b18622eab24427f830dcf25d939c211
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.01 Å`。扭转后施加到每个原子笛卡尔坐标分量的高斯标准差。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.01 Å`. Gaussian standard deviation applied to each Cartesian "
"atomic-coordinate component after torsion."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:72
#: bfabed6719e74ecdbdf4754044580746
msgid "边界"
msgstr "Boundaries"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:74
#: 4550f437ac314be398d84c5976f91473
msgid "输出边界（pbc_mode）"
msgstr "Output Boundaries (pbc_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:76
#: 1050029ef1af4b5ab8d019fed87d30e6
msgid "`str`，默认 `auto`。"
msgstr "`str`, default `auto`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md
#: e601c2f0adc24ff0b04783dea3fa49b2
msgid "选项"
msgstr "Option"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md
#: 3409b9e1ae2d41b994cdb05d03e58414
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md
#: 8fc409e651a24ab3a2fb1e81c4e97a33
msgid "`auto`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md
#: 84b7f873d58d457fb99d2f59cc8e5d53
msgid "跟随输入；接受全三维周期或完全非周期输入"
msgstr "Follow the input; accepts fully three-dimensional periodic or fully nonperiodic inputs"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md
#: cad00e32999b489888e809ebb67a804e
msgid "`yes`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md
#: fed28b56980946abafcf57978387bb34
msgid "强制按全三维周期体系处理"
msgstr "Force treatment as a fully three-dimensionally periodic system"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md
#: e1425e4bc08f4c279b97a81aeb5ba8ae
msgid "`no`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md
#: e5e7d9c0c5dd4cf0bb6e2f11709c4213
msgid "按非周期分子处理，输出 PBC 关闭"
msgstr "Treat as a nonperiodic molecule and disable PBC in the output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:84
#: 08db622dcd2c4717a223da90c24acd1e
msgid "一维或二维混合 PBC 在 `auto` 模式下会明确报错；需要先选择非周期模式或提供完整周期晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"Mixed one- or two-dimensional PBC reports an explicit error in `auto` mode. Select "
"nonperiodic mode first or provide a fully periodic cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:86
#: 955691e3c8914133bbfe5b7bd858a0ce
msgid "非周期显示盒（nonpbc_box_size）"
msgstr "Nonperiodic Display Box (nonpbc_box_size)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:88
#: e30d9bfc528d4b4883388a2564712b41
msgid "`float`，默认 `100 Å`。仅在解析出的输出为非周期时生效；它不参与周期碰撞检查。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `100 Å`. Used only when the resolved output is nonperiodic; it does "
"not participate in periodic collision checks."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:90
#: 0e3fff7f03e843419b99e739b89442fc
msgid "拓扑识别"
msgstr "Topology Detection"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:92
#: 45200999bdfc4f3bba133f2267bb95b8
msgid "大分子阈值（local_cutoff）"
msgstr "Large-Molecule Threshold (local_cutoff)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:94
#: 6e823e65823947aa82eec3e366230958
msgid "`int`，默认 150 个原子。输入超过该规模后，旋转使用受限局部子树。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 150 atoms. Above this input size, rotation uses a bounded local "
"subtree."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:96
#: 725da59205c340be9049bf794590cee2
msgid "局部子树上限（local_subtree）"
msgstr "Local-Subtree Limit (local_subtree)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:98
#: 88316bf5d3af4ffbbe8fad7dc55707b4
msgid "`int`，默认 40 个原子。仅在大分子局部模式中生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default 40 atoms. Used only in large-molecule local mode."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:100
#: de291db5847a4862815d2de1e224d8be
msgid "成键检测半径（bond_detect_factor）"
msgstr "Bond-Detection Radius (bond_detect_factor)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:102
#: 87cdd579737945c38bea36844ab274fd
msgid "`float`，默认 1.15。最大检测距离为该系数乘以两原子的共价半径之和，必须大于 0。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 1.15. The maximum detection distance is this factor multiplied by "
"the sum of the two covalent radii, and must be greater than 0."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:104
#: 89788354f5904969a6c61ce24ef2fb2c
msgid "Pauling 衰减长度（bo_c_const）"
msgstr "Pauling Decay Length (bo_c_const)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:106
#: 37224cb3964049e5a8da17b22ad9d917
msgid "`float`，默认 `0.3 Å`。控制键级估算随距离的衰减速度。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.3 Å`. Controls how rapidly the estimated bond order decays with "
"distance."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:108
#: 83948fe5a5954a1eaa49c599a2c0f261
msgid "键级阈值（bo_threshold）"
msgstr "bo_threshold"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:110
#: a13b68a95f224a688c1fd1a751b4d8b1
msgid "`float`，默认 0.2，范围 `[0,1]`。估算键级达到阈值后才建立拓扑边。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0.2, range `[0,1]`. A topology edge is created only when the "
"estimated bond order reaches this threshold."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:112
#: 53fe3dc54ecc4100941547ef58cbc682
msgid "短键旋转截止（mult_bond_factor）"
msgstr "Short-Bond Rotation Cutoff (mult_bond_factor)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:114
#: 44db71c770d54ae78b5deade950b03cb
msgid "`float`，默认 0.87。短于该共价半径系数的键不参与旋转；估算多重键也不会作为普通单键旋转。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0.87. Bonds shorter than this covalent-radius factor do not rotate; "
"estimated multiple bonds are also not rotated as ordinary single bonds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:116
#: 2bf469dceee7476a8e045ce00072a105
msgid "几何保护"
msgstr "Geometry Protection"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:118
#: de772fcb16ff46df862fdf27d1c52035
msgid "最小原始键长（bond_keep_min_factor）"
msgstr "Minimum Original Bond Length (bond_keep_min_factor)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:120
#: 25d4815e242e4ad39b2817f174d28e1c
msgid "`float`，默认 0.6。原始检测键不得短于该共价半径系数；0 表示关闭下限。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0.6. Original detected bonds cannot be shorter than this covalent-"
"radius factor; 0 disables the lower bound."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:122
#: 76c1fe53899d4badaefa67ac75c340ee
msgid "最大原始键长（bond_keep_max_factor）"
msgstr "Maximum Original Bond Length (bond_keep_max_factor)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:124
#: 37224cb3964049e5a8da17b22ad9d917
msgid "`float`，默认 1.15。仅在启用最大键长限制后生效，且不能小于最小键长系数。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 1.15. Used only when the maximum bond-length limit is enabled and "
"cannot be smaller than the minimum bond-length factor."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:126
#: f72ccb76b03d47e7b8a5d7eb133405f2
msgid "启用最大键长（bond_keep_max_enable）"
msgstr "Enable Maximum Bond Length (bond_keep_max_enable)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:128
#: 37224cb3964049e5a8da17b22ad9d917
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后检查原始检测键的长度上限。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, checks the upper length limit of original "
"detected bonds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:130
#: 6ba53fa41af74567b3cd5d0c1783773b
msgid "最小非键距离（nonbond_min_factor）"
msgstr "Minimum Nonbonded Distance (nonbond_min_factor)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:132
#: c11b2400fcdf46ebacfde1a076d0fa0f
msgid "`float`，默认 0.8。非键原子对不得短于该共价半径系数；0 表示关闭检查。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0.8. Nonbonded atom pairs cannot be closer than this covalent-radius"
" factor; 0 disables the check."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:134
#: c9fd4f03a63347ec8014a4a0684635f7
msgid "每个输出重试次数（max_retries）"
msgstr "Retries per Output (max_retries)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:136
#: 4aa4fd1865ba486d99bdd49a3cf1017b
msgid "`int`，默认 12。每次失败重试会把扭转增量和坐标噪声减半；次数越多，最终通过的构象可能越接近输入。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 12. Every failed retry halves the torsion increment and coordinate "
"noise. With more retries, an accepted conformer may become increasingly close to the "
"input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:138
#: 7ffc301e03a14b6f8a3b6daab7b83a23
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:140
#: e731f0c73cea45fab822e6c4a98ee512
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:142
#: ef8d08fe2723430aa0f978a5af46e0ba
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后，同一输入、参数和 seed 可复现。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, the same input, parameters, and seed are "
"reproducible."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:144
#: 5ea927b21bae4bd7967943b9f7d03612
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:146
#: f0fbf9d9c6d24d61b3ea59e56dd677d4
msgid "`int`，默认 0，仅在 `use_seed=true` 时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default 0, used only when `use_seed=true`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:148
#: a30cac8b73904b1b8c6fef848e622e13
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:150
#: b680f12429084f019e6aa59836abd078
msgid ""
"**预览没有可旋转键。** "
"先确认输入是否确有非环内部单键，再查看检测键数和分子连通分量。若分子被拆成多个分量，可小幅增大成键检测半径；若相邻分子被错误连成一体，应减小该值或提高键级阈值。"
msgstr ""
"**The preview shows no rotatable bonds.** First confirm that the input contains a "
"non-ring internal single bond, then inspect detected-bond count and molecular "
"connected components. If a molecule is split into several components, increase the "
"bond-detection radius slightly. If neighboring molecules are incorrectly connected, "
"decrease it or raise the bond-order threshold."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:152
#: be40a1cd42b74d0dafabf100341ad3fd
msgid "**实际输出少于请求数。** 候选未通过几何保护。先收窄扭转角或减小坐标噪声，再根据失败原因调整相应距离阈值。"
msgstr ""
"**The actual output count is smaller than requested.** Candidates failed geometry "
"protection. Narrow the torsion range or reduce coordinate noise first, then adjust "
"the relevant distance threshold according to the failure reason."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:154
#: e44b147777b6489c8d1f5cf7461edac1
msgid "**非周期输出为什么带有 cell？** 该立方 cell 只用于显示和文件格式兼容，PBC 仍为 false。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does a nonperiodic output contain a cell?** The cubic cell is used only for "
"display and file-format compatibility; PBC remains false."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:156
#: 8ed680a659604475b7da1866be858b89
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/organic-mol-config-pbc-card.md:158
#: 0d8bf9121b8046d9bcfb77d7d46b86aa
#, python-brace-format
msgid "TG(req={请求数},ok={成功数},sig={坐标噪声},pbc={边界模式})\n"
msgstr ""
"TG(req={requested count},ok={successful count},sig={coordinate noise},pbc={boundary "
"mode})\n"

#~ msgid "对有机分子体系进行扭转角采样 + 高斯局域扰动，生成构象候选用作训练数据。通过键长约束和非键最小距离约束保证输出的化学合理性——不会把构象采样做成断键采样。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Generate training candidates for organic molecular"
#~ " systems by combining torsional sampling with "
#~ "local Gaussian perturbations. Bond-length and "
#~ "nonbonded-distance constraints reject chemically "
#~ "implausible results, keeping conformation sampling "
#~ "distinct from bond-breaking sampling."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个有机分子晶体结构，分子拓扑可由程序自动识别"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** An organic molecular-crystal structure"
#~ " whose molecular topology can be inferred "
#~ "automatically."

#~ msgid "`Bond Keep Min Factor` = `[0.6]`，`Bond Keep Max Enable` = 勾选"
#~ msgstr "`Bond Keep Min Factor` = `[0.6]`; enable `Bond Keep Max Enable`."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 最多 100 个构象，带 `TG(n=100,sig=0.03,pbc=auto)` 标签"
#~ msgstr "**Output:** Up to 100 conformations labeled `TG(n=100,sig=0.03,pbc=auto)`."

#~ msgid "抽查键长分布：输出分子中没有明显短于 `0.6 * r0` 或长于 `1.15 * r0` 的键"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect the bond-length distribution. Output "
#~ "molecules should have no bonds appreciably "
#~ "shorter than `0.6 * r0` or longer than"
#~ " `1.15 * r0`."

#~ msgid "抽查非键距离：没有不同片段原子重叠（距离 > `0.8 * r_vdw`）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Inspect nonbonded distances and confirm that "
#~ "atoms from different fragments do not overlap;"
#~ " distances should exceed `0.8 * r_vdw`."

#~ msgid "如果成功率低（< 10%），放宽 `bond_keep_max_factor` 或增大 `max_retries`"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If fewer than 10% of candidates are "
#~ "accepted, relax `bond_keep_max_factor` or increase "
#~ "`max_retries`."

#~ msgid "研究有机分子晶体、聚合物、分子体系的构象空间"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You are exploring conformational space in an"
#~ " organic crystal, polymer, or molecular system."

#~ msgid "分子本身是刚性的（如苯环），扭转采样没有意义"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The molecule is rigid, such as an "
#~ "isolated benzene ring, so torsional sampling "
#~ "adds no meaningful degree of freedom."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 100。每个输入帧生成多少个构象候选，20~100 为常规。实际有效输出 = 候选数 "
#~ "x 成功率，后面约束越严、保留率越低，产出的结构数可能明显少于候选数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `100`. Number of conformation "
#~ "candidates attempted per input frame; 20–100 "
#~ "is typical. The effective output count is "
#~ "the candidate count multiplied by the "
#~ "acceptance rate. Stricter constraints lower that "
#~ "rate, so the card may return substantially "
#~ "fewer structures than requested."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`。二面角旋转范围（度），格式 "
#~ "`[最小值, 最大值]`。±30° 保守，±180° 全覆盖。范围越大成功率越低，你需要权衡覆盖面和出产率。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`, default: `(-180.0, 180.0)`. "
#~ "Dihedral rotation range in degrees, expressed "
#~ "as `[minimum, maximum]`. ±30° is conservative; "
#~ "±180° spans the full angular range. Wider "
#~ "scans typically reduce acceptance, so balance "
#~ "coverage against yield."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 50。每个构象最多旋转几个二面角，常规 1~5。设越多构象越复杂、成功率越低，建议从 3 起步试探。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `50`. Maximum number of "
#~ "dihedrals rotated in one candidate. A "
#~ "practical range is 1–5. Rotating more "
#~ "dihedrals creates more complex conformations and "
#~ "lowers acceptance; start with 3 when tuning"
#~ " a new system."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.03 Å。局域高斯扰动的标准差，常规 0.01~0.03。数值越大原子偏移越剧烈。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.03` Å. Standard deviation "
#~ "of the local Gaussian displacement. A typical"
#~ " range is 0.01–0.03 Å; larger values "
#~ "produce stronger coordinate perturbations."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 12。每个构象候选在约束失败后的最大重试次数。增大能提高成功率但线性增加耗时——设到 20 以上时先检查是不是约束太严了。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `12`. Maximum retries after a"
#~ " candidate fails the constraints. Increasing it"
#~ " can improve yield but raises cost "
#~ "linearly. Before using more than 20 retries,"
#~ " check whether the constraints themselves are "
#~ "unnecessarily strict."

#~ msgid "`str`，默认 `'auto'`。构象扰动时的周期边界处理方式，可选 `auto` / `pbc` / `nonpbc`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default: `'auto'`. Periodic-boundary "
#~ "treatment during conformation perturbation. Choices "
#~ "are `auto`, `pbc`, and `nonpbc`."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 200。局部构象扰动的影响范围。小 cutoff 更局域，大 cutoff 会带动更大分子片段一起动——柔性链或配体适合调大。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `200`. Spatial extent of a "
#~ "local conformational perturbation. A smaller cutoff"
#~ " localizes the change; a larger cutoff "
#~ "moves a larger molecular fragment and may "
#~ "be appropriate for flexible chains or ligands."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 100。打开后扭转沿分子拓扑传播到子树，适合真实单键旋转；关掉时更像纯局部坐标噪声。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `100`. When enabled, a torsion"
#~ " propagates through the molecular-topology "
#~ "subtree, as expected for rotation about a "
#~ "real single bond. When disabled, the operation"
#~ " behaves more like local coordinate noise."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 100.0 Å。非周期分子包围盒尺寸。盒子太小会制造假镜像接触，太大只增加体积相关过滤风险。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `100.0` Å. Bounding-box size"
#~ " for a nonperiodic molecule. A box that "
#~ "is too small creates artificial image "
#~ "contacts; an excessively large box can "
#~ "interact poorly with volume-based filters."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 1.15。成键检测因子，数值越大越容易把较远的原子对判定为成键。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `1.15`. Bond-detection factor. "
#~ "Larger values make more distant atom pairs "
#~ "likely to be classified as bonded."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.6。允许的最短键长 = `factor * r0`（r0 为平衡键长）。设太小会放过断键结构，设太大又可能拒绝略压缩的合理构象。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.6`. Minimum allowed bond "
#~ "length, `factor * r0`, where `r0` is the"
#~ " reference bond length. A value that is "
#~ "too small admits broken or collapsed "
#~ "geometries; one that is too large rejects "
#~ "reasonably compressed conformations."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 1.15。允许的最长键长上限系数。值太小会拒绝合理的柔性拉伸构象，太大又可能放过实质断键的结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `1.15`. Maximum bond-length "
#~ "factor. Too small a value rejects legitimate"
#~ " flexible stretching; too large a value can"
#~ " admit effectively broken bonds."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后才启用键长上限检查。当你需要严格保护分子内键不被拉伸时打开；但如果体系本身含软键或反应路径，打开反而会误删高能但有意义的构型。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `false`. Enables the maximum "
#~ "bond-length check. Use it when intramolecular "
#~ "bonds must remain intact. For systems with "
#~ "soft bonds or reactive pathways, it may "
#~ "reject high-energy but scientifically relevant "
#~ "configurations."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.87。多重键（C=C、C=O、芳香环等）的识别系数。含这些键的体系需要用它限制扭转自由度；纯单键柔性分子影响很小。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.87`. Detection factor for "
#~ "multiple bonds such as C=C, C=O, and "
#~ "aromatic bonds. It restricts torsional freedom "
#~ "in systems containing such bonds and has "
#~ "little effect on molecules dominated by "
#~ "flexible single bonds."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.3。键级估计的衰减常数，影响哪些键被当成强键保护。除非你在调试键识别，保持默认就好。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.3`. Decay constant used "
#~ "in bond-order estimation and therefore in "
#~ "deciding which bonds receive strong protection. "
#~ "Keep the default unless you are diagnosing "
#~ "bond detection."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.2。化学键保留的键级阈值。阈值越高，只有更强的键被识别和保护；阈值越低，更多弱相互作用被当成键，可能过度限制构象自由度。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.2`. Bond-order threshold "
#~ "for preserving chemical bonds. Raising it "
#~ "protects only stronger bonds; lowering it "
#~ "classifies more weak interactions as bonds and"
#~ " may overconstrain conformational freedom."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.8。非键原子允许的最近距离 = `factor * r_vdw`（r_vdw 为范德华半径）。发现原子穿插时调大到 0.9~1.0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default: `0.8`. Minimum nonbonded distance,"
#~ " `factor * r_vdw`, where `r_vdw` is the "
#~ "van der Waals reference distance used by "
#~ "the implementation. Increase this to 0.9–1.0 "
#~ "if atoms interpenetrate."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 0。固定随机种子值。仅 `use_seed` 打开时生效，两个不同 seed 产生两组不同的扭转角和扰动方向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default: `0`. Fixed random seed used"
#~ " only when `use_seed` is enabled. Different "
#~ "seeds produce different torsion angles and "
#~ "perturbation directions."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出成功率很低（<10%）。** 约束太严或者扭转范围太大导致大部分候选被拒绝。先收窄 `torsion_range_deg`，增大"
#~ " `max_retries`，放宽 `bond_keep_max_factor`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The acceptance rate is below 10%.** Most "
#~ "candidates are being rejected because the "
#~ "constraints are too strict or the torsion "
#~ "range is too wide. First narrow "
#~ "`torsion_range_deg`, then increase `max_retries` or "
#~ "relax `bond_keep_max_factor` as justified by the "
#~ "chemistry."

#~ msgid "**键被拉断了。** `bond_keep_max_enable` 没开，或者 `bond_keep_max_factor` 太大。开启该约束并设定合理上限。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Bonds are being stretched to the point "
#~ "of breaking.** `bond_keep_max_enable` is disabled or"
#~ " `bond_keep_max_factor` is too large. Enable the"
#~ " upper bond-length constraint and choose a"
#~ " chemically defensible limit."

#~ msgid "**非键原子穿插。** `nonbond_min_factor` 太小。增大到 0.9~1.0。"
#~ msgstr "**Nonbonded atoms interpenetrate.** Increase `nonbond_min_factor` to 0.9–1.0."

#~ msgid "**扭转角采样没有效果。** 确认分子中存在可旋转的单键。刚性环分子没有可旋转二面角。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Torsional sampling has no visible effect.** "
#~ "Confirm that the molecule contains a rotatable"
#~ " single bond. A rigid ring has no "
#~ "freely rotatable dihedral."

#~ msgid "`TG(n={候选数},sig={sigma},pbc={模式})`"
#~ msgstr "`TG(n={candidate count},sig={sigma},pbc={mode})`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "勾选 `use_seed` + 固定 `seed` → 相同输入可复现。构象生成受 "
#~ "seed + 结构稳定 ID 联合控制，不同 seed 产生不同的扭转角和扰动方向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `use_seed` and fix `seed` to reproduce"
#~ " the result for the same input. "
#~ "Conformation generation is controlled jointly by "
#~ "the seed and the structure's stable ID; "
#~ "different seeds produce different torsions and "
#~ "perturbation directions."

#~ msgid "有机构象采样（Organic Mol Config）"
#~ msgstr "Organic Molecular Conformation Sampling (Organic Mol Config)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "对有机分子体系做单键子树旋转，并可叠加逐原子的高斯坐标噪声。程序先按共价半径、距离上限和 Pauling "
#~ "键级阈值建立启发式拓扑；只有从拓扑中删除后能分开两侧子树的内部键才会参与旋转，因此环内键不会被当成普通可旋转单键。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Rotate single-bond subtrees in organic "
#~ "molecular systems and optionally add per-atom"
#~ " Gaussian coordinate noise. The program first "
#~ "builds a heuristic topology from covalent "
#~ "radii, distance limits, and Pauling bond-order"
#~ " thresholds. Only internal bonds whose removal"
#~ " separates the two subtrees participate in "
#~ "rotation, so ring bonds are not treated "
#~ "as ordinary rotatable single bonds."

#~ msgid "每个候选还要经过原始键对的长度检查和非键原子的碰撞检查；失败时会减半旋转角与噪声后重试，全部重试仍失败的候选会被跳过，不会用未变化的输入结构冒充成功输出。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Each candidate also undergoes checks on "
#~ "original bonded-pair lengths and nonbonded "
#~ "collisions. On failure, the card halves the"
#~ " rotation angle and noise and retries; "
#~ "candidates that still fail all retries are "
#~ "skipped rather than returned as unchanged "
#~ "pseudo-successes."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\\Delta\\theta\\sim U(\\theta_{\\min},\\theta_{\\max}),\\quad "
#~ "\\Delta\\mathbf{r}_i\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2),\\quad d_{ij}\\text{ "
#~ "的阈值均按 }r_i^{\\mathrm{cov}}+r_j^{\\mathrm{cov}}\\text{ 缩放}"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "\\Delta\\theta\\sim U(\\theta_{\\min},\\theta_{\\max}),\\quad "
#~ "\\Delta\\mathbf{r}_i\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,\\sigma^2),\\quad d_{ij}\\text{ "
#~ "thresholds are scaled by "
#~ "}r_i^{\\mathrm{cov}}+r_j^{\\mathrm{cov}}\\text{.}"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "$\\Delta\\theta$ 是被选可旋转键的子树转角，$\\sigma$ 是逐 Cartesian "
#~ "分量的高斯标准差， $r_i^{\\mathrm{cov}}$ 是元素共价半径。拓扑、键长保护和非键碰撞三道检查共同决定候选是否 "
#~ "接受，公式中的随机抽样本身并不保证化学合理。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "$\\Delta\\theta$ is the subtree rotation angle "
#~ "for a selected rotatable bond, $\\sigma$ is"
#~ " the Gaussian standard deviation per Cartesian"
#~ " component, and $r_i^{\\mathrm{cov}}$ is the "
#~ "covalent radius of element $i$. Topology, "
#~ "bond-length protection, and nonbonded-collision "
#~ "checks jointly determine whether a candidate "
#~ "is accepted; random sampling alone does not"
#~ " guarantee chemical validity."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "这里的“键”和“可旋转键”来自几何启发式，不是 RDKit "
#~ "等化学感知工具给出的正式键型。金属配位、离子对、非常规价态或已经严重畸变的输入可能识别错误；先看卡片首帧预览中的“检测键数 / "
#~ "可旋转键数”，再抽查输出。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The `bonds` and `rotatable bonds` here come"
#~ " from geometric heuristics, not formal bond "
#~ "types from a chemistry-aware tool such "
#~ "as RDKit. Metal coordination, ion pairs, "
#~ "unusual valences, or severely distorted inputs "
#~ "may be identified incorrectly; inspect the "
#~ "preview's detected/rotatable bond counts before "
#~ "reviewing outputs."

#~ msgid "场景：模型在小分子构象变化上的力预测完全不准"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: force predictions fail when a small molecule changes conformation"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在一个有机分子晶体上训练了一个 NEP 模型，分子内的平衡键长和键角都学得不错。但你把同一个分子旋转一个二面角后，力的 MAE"
#~ " 跳了 4 倍。诊断发现训练集里每个分子只有一种构象——模型不知道扭转角改变时力场该怎么变。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "You trained an NEP model for an organic"
#~ " molecular crystal. It reproduces equilibrium "
#~ "bond lengths and angles, but the force "
#~ "MAE increases fourfold after rotating one "
#~ "dihedral in the same molecule. The training"
#~ " set contains only one conformation per "
#~ "molecule, so the model has no basis for"
#~ " learning how forces change along torsional "
#~ "degrees of freedom."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 有机分子的势能面在二面角方向上是多极值的（如 gauche 和 anti "
#~ "构象）。如果训练集只有一种构象，模型在这个柔性自由度上只能外推。需要系统地对可旋转二面角做采样，并保留那些键长不崩、非键不穿插的构象作为训练样本。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** The potential-energy surface of "
#~ "an organic molecule often has multiple minima"
#~ " along a dihedral coordinate, such as "
#~ "gauche and anti conformers. With only one "
#~ "conformation in the training set, the model"
#~ " must extrapolate along that flexible degree "
#~ "of freedom. Sample rotatable dihedrals "
#~ "systematically and retain candidates that preserve"
#~ " bonds and avoid nonbonded overlap."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个有机分子或全三维周期的分子晶体；程序按当前几何估计分子拓扑"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** an organic molecule or a fully "
#~ "three-dimensional periodic molecular crystal; the"
#~ " program estimates molecular topology from the"
#~ " current geometry."

#~ msgid "**目标：** 每帧生成 100 个构象候选，扭转角在 ±60 度内采样，sigma 0.03 的高斯位移"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Goal:** Generate 100 conformation candidates per"
#~ " frame, sample torsions within ±60°, and "
#~ "add Gaussian displacements with σ = 0.03 "
#~ "Å."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

