#~ "provides only a geometric heuristic topology."

#~ msgid "只需要坐标扰动 → 用 `Atomic Perturb`"
#~ msgstr "You need only coordinate noise → use `Atomic Perturb`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 100。每个输入结构尝试生成多少个候选，20–100 "
#~ "为常规。保护条件失败的候选会被跳过，所以实际输出数可能小于该值；若一个都没有通过，卡片直接报错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default 100. Number of candidates "
#~ "attempted per input; 20–100 is typical. "
#~ "Candidates that fail protection checks are "
#~ "skipped, so the actual output may be "
#~ "smaller; if none passes, the card fails."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, "
#~ "180.0)`。这是加到当前构象上的**旋转增量**范围，不是输出二面角的绝对目标值。±30° 较保守，±180° "
#~ "覆盖更广；范围越大，几何保护失败概率通常越高。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`, default `(-180.0, 180.0)`. "
#~ "The **rotation increment** added to the "
#~ "current conformation, not an absolute target "
#~ "dihedral. ±30° is conservative and ±180° "
#~ "covers more space; wider ranges usually "
#~ "increase geometry-protection failures."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.03 Å。扭转之后，对**每个原子**独立添加笛卡尔高斯噪声；它不是只作用于局部子树。常规可从 0.01–0.03 Å 开始。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 0.03 Å. After torsion, add"
#~ " independent Cartesian Gaussian noise to **every"
#~ " atom**; it is not limited to the "
#~ "local subtree. A typical starting range is "
#~ "0.01–0.03 Å."

#~ msgid "PBC 和局部环境"
#~ msgstr "Periodic boundaries and local environment"

#~ msgid "`auto`：只在输入三个 PBC 方向都打开时使用周期模式；普通无周期分子不会因为带一个显示 cell 就被误判为周期体系。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`auto`: use periodic mode only when all "
#~ "three input PBC directions are enabled; an "
#~ "ordinary nonperiodic molecule is not misclassified"
#~ " merely because it has a display cell."

#~ msgid "`yes`：强制全三维周期，输入必须有有限且非奇异的 3×3 cell。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`yes`: force full three-dimensional periodicity; "
#~ "the input must have a finite, nonsingular "
#~ "3×3 cell."

#~ msgid "`no`：按非周期分子处理，并在输出中写入显示盒。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`no`: treat the input as a nonperiodic "
#~ "molecule and write a display box to the"
#~ " output."

#~ msgid "二维或一维混合 PBC 暂不支持；`auto` 会明确报错，不会把部分周期静默改成全三维周期。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Mixed two- or one-dimensional PBC is not"
#~ " supported yet; `auto` fails explicitly instead"
#~ " of silently converting partial periodicity to"
#~ " full three-dimensional periodicity."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 150。这不是距离 cutoff，而是切换局部模式的**总原子数阈值**。当输入原子数大于该值时，每次旋转的子树会受"
#~ " `仅旋转局部子树`（`local_subtree`）限制；小体系则旋转完整一侧子树。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default 150. This is not a "
#~ "distance cutoff, but the **total-atom "
#~ "threshold** for switching to local mode. When"
#~ " the input exceeds it, each rotation is "
#~ "limited by `Rotate local subtree only` "
#~ "(`local_subtree`); smaller systems rotate the "
#~ "complete subtree on one side."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 40。局部模式中，一条键一侧最多一起旋转的原子数。它只有在输入原子数超过 `局部截断距离`（`local_cutoff`）时生效。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default 40. In local mode, maximum "
#~ "number of atoms rotated together on one "
#~ "side of a bond. It takes effect only "
#~ "when the input exceeds `Local cutoff` "
#~ "(`local_cutoff`)."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 100.0 Å。非周期输出被居中后写入的立方显示 cell 边长。输出 PBC"
#~ " 仍为 false，因此该盒子不会参与碰撞检查，也不会制造周期镜像。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 100.0 Å. Edge length of "
#~ "the cubic display cell written after centering"
#~ " a nonperiodic output. Output PBC remains "
#~ "false, so this box is not used for "
#~ "collision checks and does not create periodic"
#~ " images."

#~ msgid "键识别和键长约束"
#~ msgstr "Bond detection and bond-length constraints"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 1.15。候选键距离必须不超过 `factor * "
#~ "(r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`，同时还要通过 `键级阈值`（`bo_threshold`）。数值越大越容易把相邻分子或配位接触误识别为键。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 1.15. Candidate bond distances "
#~ "must not exceed `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)` "
#~ "and must pass `Bond-order threshold` "
#~ "(`bo_threshold`). Larger values make adjacent "
#~ "molecules or coordination contacts more likely "
#~ "to be misidentified as bonds."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.6。原始检测键允许的最短距离为 `factor * "
#~ "(r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`。它防的是过度压缩，不是断键；设太大会拒绝合理的短键。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 0.6. The shortest allowed "
#~ "original detected bond is `factor * "
#~ "(r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`. This prevents over-compression, "
#~ "not bond breaking; setting it too high "
#~ "rejects reasonable short bonds."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后才启用键长上限检查；关闭时没有隐藏的默认上限。研究非反应构象时建议打开；反应路径或软配位键可能需要关闭。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default false. Enables the bond-length"
#~ " upper-bound check; when disabled, no "
#~ "hidden default upper bound applies. Enable it"
#~ " for nonreactive conformations; reaction paths or"
#~ " soft coordination bonds may require it to"
#~ " remain disabled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.87。短于 `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)` "
#~ "的键不参与旋转；估计键级大于等于 2 的键也不参与。环内键由于不是拓扑桥边，同样不会旋转。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 0.87. Bonds shorter than "
#~ "`factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)` are not rotated; "
#~ "estimated bond order ≥ 2 is also "
#~ "excluded. Ring bonds are likewise not rotated"
#~ " because they are not topological bridge "
#~ "edges."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.3 Å。用于 `exp((r_i^cov+r_j^cov-d)/c)` "
#~ "的衰减常数。它影响拓扑边和估计键级，除非预览中的检测键数明显不合理，否则保持默认。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 0.3 Å. Decay constant in "
#~ "`exp((r_i^cov+r_j^cov-d)/c)`. It affects topology edges"
#~ " and estimated bond order; keep the default"
#~ " unless the preview's detected-bond count "
#~ "is clearly unreasonable."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.2。估计 Pauling 键级必须高于该值才会形成拓扑边；阈值越低，越容易把弱接触当成键。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 0.2. The estimated Pauling "
#~ "bond order must exceed this value to "
#~ "form a topology edge; lower thresholds more"
#~ " easily treat weak contacts as bonds."

#~ msgid "非键约束"
#~ msgstr "Nonbonded constraints"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0.8。非键原子允许的最近距离为 `factor * "
#~ "(r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`；这里使用的是共价半径，不是范德华半径。发现穿插时可适当调大，但过大会大量拒绝紧密堆积的分子晶体候选。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default 0.8. The nearest allowed "
#~ "nonbonded distance is `factor * (r_i^cov+r_j^cov)`;"
#~ " covalent radii, not van der Waals radii,"
#~ " are used. Increase it moderately when "
#~ "atoms interpenetrate, but an excessive value "
#~ "rejects many densely packed molecular-crystal "
#~ "candidates."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开 + 固定 seed 后同参数同输入可复现。种子与结构的稳定 ID 联合影响采样路径。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default: `false`. Enable with a fixed"
#~ " seed for reproducible sampling from the "
#~ "same input and parameters. The seed and "
#~ "the structure's stable ID jointly determine "
#~ "the sampling path."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 0。固定随机种子值。仅 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）打开时生效，两个不同 seed 产生两组不同的扭转角和扰动方向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default 0. Fixed random-seed value. "
#~ "Used only when `Use random seed` (`use_seed`)"
#~ " is enabled; different seeds produce different"
#~ " torsion angles and perturbation directions."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`use_seed=True`。"
#~ msgstr "Active only when `use_seed=True`."

