#~ "When filtering an organic system, prioritize "
#~ "bond lengths, nonbonded distances, and topology "
#~ "preservation."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出数量明显小于请求值。** 其余候选没有通过保护条件。先检查预览中的检测键和可旋转键是否合理，再收窄 "
#~ "`扭转角增量`（`torsion_range_deg`）、减小高斯噪声，或调整真正导致失败的保护阈值。增大 "
#~ "`最大重试次数`（`max_retries`）只会用更小扰动继续尝试。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The output count is far below the "
#~ "request.** The remaining candidates failed "
#~ "protection checks. First inspect whether the "
#~ "detected and rotatable bonds in the preview"
#~ " are reasonable, then narrow `Torsion-angle "
#~ "range` (`torsion_range_deg`), reduce Gaussian noise, "
#~ "or adjust the threshold that actually causes"
#~ " failure. Increasing `Maximum retries` (`max_retries`)"
#~ " only retries with smaller perturbations."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**键被拉断了。** `启用最大保留键长`（`bond_keep_max_enable`）没开，或者 "
#~ "`最大保留键长系数`（`bond_keep_max_factor`）太大。开启该约束并设定合理上限。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**A bond was stretched too far.** `Enable "
#~ "maximum kept-bond length` (`bond_keep_max_enable`) "
#~ "is disabled, or `Maximum kept-bond length "
#~ "factor` (`bond_keep_max_factor`) is too large. "
#~ "Enable the constraint and set a reasonable "
#~ "upper bound."

#~ msgid "**非键原子穿插。** `非键原子最小距离系数`（`nonbond_min_factor`）太小。增大到 0.9~1.0。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Nonbonded atoms interpenetrate.** `Nonbonded minimum-"
#~ "distance factor` (`nonbond_min_factor`) is too "
#~ "small. Increase it to 0.9–1.0."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**预览显示 0 条可旋转键。** 环内键、多重键、端基键以及一侧没有邻居的键不会参与子树旋转。若高斯噪声大于 "
#~ "0，卡片仍能生成坐标扰动；若只想做这种扰动，`Atomic Perturb` 更直接。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**The preview shows zero rotatable bonds.** "
#~ "Ring bonds, multiple bonds, terminal bonds, "
#~ "and bonds with no neighbors on one side"
#~ " do not participate in subtree rotation. If"
#~ " Gaussian noise is nonzero, the card can"
#~ " still generate coordinate perturbations; use "
#~ "`Atomic Perturb` directly if that is all "
#~ "you need."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**普通无周期分子在 Auto 下报奇异 cell。** 当前版本会按输入的 PBC "
#~ "标志判断，不会再把零 cell 当成周期晶胞；如果仍看到该错误，请确认是否手动选择了“强制全三维 PBC”。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**An ordinary nonperiodic molecule reports a "
#~ "singular cell in Auto mode.** The current "
#~ "version uses the input PBC flags and no"
#~ " longer treats a zero cell as periodic. "
#~ "If the error persists, check whether `Force"
#~ " full 3D PBC` was selected manually."

