#~ "相同输入可复现。构象生成受 seed + 结构稳定 ID 联合控制，不同 seed "
#~ "产生不同的扭转角和扰动方向。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Enable `Use random seed` (`use_seed`) and fix"
#~ " `Random seed` (`seed`) to reproduce the "
#~ "same input. Conformation generation is controlled"
#~ " jointly by the seed and stable structure"
#~ " ID; different seeds produce different torsion"
#~ " angles and perturbation directions."
